### Signup user for post list check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-list-user@example.com",
  "password": "password1234",
  "nickname": "postListUser"
}


### Login user for post list check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "post-list-user@example.com",
  "password": "password1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}


### Create old post for list check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "title": "Spring Bean question",
  "content": "Manual API check post content."
}


### Create recent post for list sort check
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "title": "Recent Spring Bean question",
  "content": "Manual API check recent post content."
}


### List posts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts


